    <string name="info">This String Gauge Calculator estimates the string gauge (suggesting D\'Addario plain steel strings) based on \n - the frequency of the pitch (in hertz),\n - the scale length (in inch),\n - and the tension (in pounds).\n\nThe app calculates the string gauge with the unit weight of the string (unit weight = (tension x 386.4) / (2 x length x frequency)^2) and the following formula:\n2.1242 * unit weight ^ 0.5\n\nSimply enter these parameters, click the refresh button, and the app will provide you with an estimated string gauge, making it easier to select the right strings for your guitar.</string>
